### Reporting hierarchy

Use the following hierarchy:

1. Contract;
2. Account;
3. Paying household;
4. Entitled household;
5. Active viewing household;
6. Individual profile/viewer;
7. Concurrent stream.

Paying household should be the principal commercial unit, recognized revenue the principal accounting revenue measure, and cash collected the principal liquidity measure.

