# 11. Economics and decision dashboard

Before final approval, management should provide a populated dashboard—not placeholders—showing:

- five-year retrofit capex;
- amount by project tier;
- amount by data grade;
- EU Taxonomy-aligned amount;
- local-taxonomy overlap;
