- The five additional capabilities have not yet been specified.
- The company can implement market-specific feature flags, claims, consent flows, audit trails, version controls, rollback, and rapid suspension.
- The company may use consumer, retail, clinical, employer, payer, or health-system channels.

These assumptions must become approved product requirements before submissions or public claims.

