#### Commercial and strategic value

- Activation and retention;
- Returns and refunds;
- Cost per supported user;
- Contribution margin;
- Clinician adoption;
- Care-pathway conversion;
- Evidence value generated.

For every metric, define the baseline, target, measurement window, owner, review cadence, and escalation action before pivotal unblinding or launch-data review.

