The company will maintain separate, documented rules for each worker category.

| Worker category | Compensation framework | Transparency | Progression | Variable pay/equity | Equity analysis | Owner |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| Direct employee | Global/local band | Global standard and local law | Defined | Plan-specific | Included where lawful | Local entity |
| EOR employee | Same band or documented equivalent | Company, EOR, and local law | Defined or equivalent | Contract/plan-specific | Included where lawful | Company and EOR |
| Agency worker | Separate framework | Contract and local law | Defined separately | Agency/company terms | Risk review | Agency and Procurement |
| Contractor | Separate contractor policy | Contract and local law | Not employee progression | Contractual | Misclassification review | Legal and Procurement |

Worker classification must not be used to avoid applicable transparency, equal-pay, privacy, or employee-protection obligations.

