| Function | Responsibility |
|---|---|
| Board or board committee | Oversight of material labor, classification, safety, and reputational risk |
| Executive sponsor | Accountability for global implementation and resources |
| Global Labor Relations Council | Standards, exceptions, legal matrix, major disputes, metrics |
| Regional and country leads | Local adaptation, counsel coordination, training, escalation |
| Operations | Day-to-day engagement and lawful continuity planning |
| Legal | Status, representation, bargaining, competition, privacy, and retaliation advice |
