| Compliance and audit | Testing, investigations, records, corrective action |
| Partner management | Partner standards, audits, remediation, and escalation |
| Independent oversight | Retaliation, interference, systemic due-process review |

No manager may independently promise changes to pay, classification, representation, enforcement policy, or legal rights.

