## 19. Implementation roadmap

### Phase 1: Validate

- establish the global steering group;
- confirm the twelve-country scope register;
- inventory legal and collective requirements;
- create role eligibility and restriction matrices;
- complete country addenda;
- complete required consultations and approvals;
- establish the policy register;
- baseline workload, visibility bias, promotion, coverage, and office-use risks.

### Phase 2: Design operations

- publish request, approval, and appeal workflows;
- create team working-agreement templates;
- establish coverage, handoff, and on-call standards;
- define security, expense, equipment, accommodation, and cross-border procedures;
- assign funding and decision owners;
- establish case tracking and data governance;
